Subject: [PATCH 17/17] =?utf-8?q?native=EF=BC=9Acdylib=20=E5=B8=A6?=
 =?utf-8?q?=E4=B8=8A=20SONAME=20libnv=5Fbionic=5Fnative.so?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A17 vendor 树用 Soong 编 Codec2 服务，Soong 按完整中间路径链接预编译库；
没有 SONAME 时 NEEDED 会记成那条路径。
---
 nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/build.rs | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/build.rs

diff --git a/nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/build.rs b/nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/build.rs
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6abf2ae
--- /dev/null
+++ b/nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/build.rs
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+// The cdylib carries DT_SONAME libnv_bionic_native.so, so a client linked by path (Soong links a prebuilt
+// shared library by its full intermediate path) still records NEEDED libnv_bionic_native.so.
+fn main() {
+    println!("cargo:rustc-cdylib-link-arg=-Wl,-soname,libnv_bionic_native.so");
+}
